Third-party components and licenses
===================================

PX4-Autopilot
  The board support files are derived from PX4-Autopilot v1.15.3
  (https://github.com/PX4/PX4-Autopilot), licensed under BSD-3-Clause.
  The prebuilt F405 bootloader (firmware/px4_bootloader_flywoo.bin) is the
  PX4 bootloader shipped for the flywoo/gn-f405 board (BSD-3-Clause).

Betaflight
  betaflight-target/config.h is the reconstructed Betaflight target for this
  board and is licensed under GPLv3, like Betaflight itself
  (https://github.com/betaflight/betaflight). It is kept separate from the
  BSD-3-Clause board support and tools.

NuttX
  Built as part of PX4; see the PX4/NuttX submodules for their licenses.

The original factory firmware backup and CLI dumps are not part of this
repository because they contain the unique MCU ID and vendor configuration.
